# Per-cycle output of the soak harness. The harness driver (run-soak.sh)
# writes cycle CSVs, bombardier JSON, and a per-cycle log here; analyze.py
# renders summary.png alongside. None of it is committed — the workflow
# uploads results/ as an Actions artifact for the operator.
# `**` so a run kept in its own subdirectory (SOAK_RESULTS_DIR=results/run1)
# is ignored too — the flat patterns matched only results/ itself.
results/**/*.csv
results/**/*.json
results/**/*.log
results/**/*.png
